time($act['due_at']))) : '' ?></span></div><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right muted"></i></a><?php endforeach;?></section><?php endforeach; if(!$modules):?><section class="card card-pad empty"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i><br>No modules or activities are available yet.</section><?php endif;?></div></div></main></div><?php require __DIR__.'/../includes/footer.php'; ?>
